commit c8ee12b93dbc8c1083b1e59bf325c979e58c2d5f
Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 26 15:39:30 2026 +0800

    integration: wire handoff into Simulator/main + hybrid CLI + HTIF VA fix

    Wires the hybrid layer into the simulator: apply_resume_from_qemu (load
    state, stage V, ResumeDriver) and enable_hybrid_handoff (arm CsrTrigger,
    drain to file at the exit trigger). Adds the Hybrid CLI block (--shared-mem-*,
    --resume-from-qemu, --handoff-out, --hybrid-enter/exit-pc) and the HTIF
    virtual-address fix so file io resolves through the resumed page tables.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

