2	// executable segments of an ELF) for the marker HINTs (slti x0, x0,
3	// 0x5A0/0x5A1) and records their PCs. At retire time the simulator
4	// queries lookup(pc) to decide whether to drain state at the trigger.
5	//
6	// Pure logic: no SystemC, no DMI bus.
